{"1129227172240068608":{"a":"<p>No power outage here at least but I spend a half hour with a trembling dog wrapped around my feet. He did not like the scary outdoors trying to come inside. But the bunny rabbit dens flooded and they got lots of exercise wrapping his leash around the post and laughing at him. <a href=\"https://t.co/mAtSBjJTZY\">t.co/mAtSBjJTZY</a></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1129227172240068608</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1129227172240068608\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2019-05-17T03:28:32Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1129280464865435649":{"a":"<p>@elonmusk I remember that girl. She gave me a mostly unused roll of outdoor telephone cable. Many phone calls were thereafter made.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/1129274835173908481\">https://x.com/elonmusk/status/1129274835173908481</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1129280464865435649</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1129280464865435649\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2019-05-17T07:00:18Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1129348109715345408":{"a":"<p>Wake Up.<br>\nStretch.<br>\nDrink a glass of water.<br>\nRemember yesterday&#x27;s events.<br>\nLet out blood curdling scream.<br>\n&quot;AAAAH! AAAAAAAAAAAH! Yesterday wasn&#x27;t a dream! I still remember!&quot;<br>\nHunt for Neo&#x27;s blue pill but a mouse has chewed it in half and it&#x27;s stuck to the carpet.<br>\nThere is no carpet.<br>\n🤦‍♂️</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1129348109715345408</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1129348109715345408\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2019-05-17T11:29:06Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>re